      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been doing a lot of meditation and box breathing lately to help with my stress. i'm really interested in the more \"unseen\" parts of it—like, how does the body actually communicate these internal signals to itself? how do these hidden processes tell our brain to switch from being stressed to being calm?",
